{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50877","headline":"省题诗二十一首 寒梧鳯栖 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 寒梧鳯栖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本向高冈植，甯将衆木齐。\n虽随杨柳落，长待鳯凰栖。\n井上枝微亚，窗前影乍低。\n九苞和月立，六律带霜飞。\n秦女含吹管，周王罢翦珪。\n既同丹穴树，那肯宿羣鸡。\n（以上各诗均见《麟角集》。\n）（此组长诗原有缺误，据《天壤阁丛书》本《麟角集》校补。\n）（〖1〗《麟角集》原署「唐水部郎中福唐王棨辅之着」，《省题诗》二十一首爲该集附录。\n原书云：「宋绍兴乙卯，八代孙苹任着作左郎，於馆阁校雠，见先郎中省题诗，录附之。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50877.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50877","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}